enxin-4)"}]]}],["$","td","1",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"$$0.15"}]]}],["$","td","2",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"$$0.12"}]]}],["$","td","3",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"-20%"}]]}],["$","td","4",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Jan 2025"}]]}]]}],["$","tr","5",{"children":[["$","td","0",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","strong","0",{"style":{"color":"#f5f5f5","fontWeight":"700"},"children":"Tencent (Hunyuan)"}]]}],["$","td","1",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"$$0.13"}]]}],["$","td","2",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"$$0.10"}]]}],["$","td","3",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"-23%"}]]}],["$","td","4",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Jan 2025"}]]}]]}],["$","tr","6",{"children":[["$","td","0",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","strong","0",{"style":{"color":"#f5f5f5","fontWeight":"700"},"children":"MiniMax (abab6)"}]]}],["$","td","1",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"$$0.09"}]]}],["$","td","2",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"$$0.06"}]]}],["$","td","3",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"-33%"}]]}],["$","td","4",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Jan 2025"}]]}]]}],["$","tr","7",{"children":[["$","td","0",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","strong","0",{"style":{"color":"#f5f5f5","fontWeight":"700"},"children":"Market Average"}]]}],["$","td","1",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"$$0.116"}]]}],["$","td","2",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"$$0.038"}]]}],["$","td","3",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","strong","0",{"style":{"color":"#f5f5f5","fontWeight":"700"},"children":"-67%"}]]}],["$","td","4",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Jan 2025"}]]}]]}]]}]]}]}],["$","blockquote","245",{"style":{"borderLeft":"4px solid #22d3ee","paddingLeft":"24px","margin":"24px 0","fontStyle":"italic","color":"#a3a3a3"},"children":[["$","p","0",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","strong","0",{"style":{"color":"#f5f5f5","fontWeight":"700"},"children":"Source:"}],["$","span","1",{"children":" Company pricing announcements, 36Kr, The Information, industry tracking"}]]}]]}],["$","p","246",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"The implications extended far beyond API pricing. The price collapse forced a fundamental reassessment of business models across the industry. Companies that had built their strategies around premium API margins — charging $0.10-0.15 per million tokens — discovered that their unit economics no longer worked. The result was a wave of strategic pivots: some companies doubled down on enterprise customization (where margins remained healthy), others pushed into application layers where AI was a feature rather than a product, and still others sought acquisition by larger players with the scale to absorb margin compression."}]]}],["$","p","248",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"What made DeepSeek's move particularly devastating to competitors was not just the price, but the open-source strategy. By releasing model weights under an MIT license, DeepSeek effectively commoditized the foundation model layer. Any company could download, fine-tune, and deploy V3 on its own infrastructure — bypassing DeepSeek's API entirely. This meant that even companies that refused to engage in the price war faced a secondary threat: their customers could simply self-host V3 and eliminate API costs entirely."}]]}],["$","hr","250",{"style":{"border":"none","borderTop":"1px solid #1a1a1a","margin":"32px 0"}}],["$","h2","252",{"style":{"fontSize":"28px","fontWeight":"600","margin":"40px 0 20px","color":"#f5f5f5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Global Adoption: The \"Global South\" Effect"}]]}],["$","p","254",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"While DeepSeek-V3 generated headlines in the US and Europe, its most profound impact occurred in regions that Western AI companies had largely ignored. The combination of open weights, MIT licensing, and ultra-low training costs created a unique value proposition for developers in Southeast Asia, Africa, Latin America, and the Middle East — regions where OpenAI and Anthropic API pricing was prohibitively expensive and where local currency devaluation made dollar-denominated services even less accessible."}]]}],["$","p","256",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"The download data tells a clear story. Of the 2 million downloads in V3's first month, approximately 40% came from outside China. India alone accounted for 350,000 downloads, driven by a nascent startup ecosystem eager to build on frontier models without the cost barriers of Western APIs. Southeast Asia — Vietnam, Indonesia, Thailand — contributed another 400,000 downloads, with several governments exploring V3 deployment for public services."}]]}],["$","div","268",{"style":{"overflowX":"auto","margin":"24px 0"},"children":["$","table",null,{"style":{"width":"100%","borderCollapse":"collapse","fontSize":"14px"},"children":[["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","th","0",{"style":{"borderBottom":"2px solid #22d3ee","padding":"12px 16px","textAlign":"left","fontWeight":"600","color":"#22d3ee"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Region"}]]}],["$","th","1",{"style":{"borderBottom":"2px solid #22d3ee","padding":"12px 16px","textAlign":"left","fontWeight":"600","color":"#22d3ee"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Estimated Downloads (Month 1)"}]]}],["$","th","2",{"style":{"borderBottom":"2px solid #22d3ee","padding":"12px 16px","textAlign":"left","fontWeight":"600","color":"#22d3ee"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Primary Use Cases"}]]}],["$","th","3",{"style":{"borderBottom":"2px solid #22d3ee","padding":"12px 16px","textAlign":"left","fontWeight":"600","color":"#22d3ee"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Notable Deployments"}]]}]]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr","0",{"children":[["$","td","0",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","strong","0",{"style":{"color":"#f5f5f5","fontWeight":"700"},"children":"China"}]]}],["$","td","1",{"style":{"b